{
  "name": "SUB · Social inbox · handle",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SUB · Social inbox: handle (Lesson 5.5)\nEvery door (Meta webhook, X mentions, forward form) calls this with one shape.\n1. Save to inbox, skipping duplicates by item_id.\n2. Label intent and urgent (the 5.3 labeller).\n3. Code computes the allowed actions from timestamps and platform rules BEFORE the agent writes a word.\n4. The agent chooses among allowed actions only (structured output).\n5. Code rejects any action not allowed, and anything with personal details in a public reply.\n6. auto -> send; otherwise Tolu approves on Telegram first; complaints and LinkedIn/TikTok drafts go to Tolu.\n7. Send in order: private reply or DM first, then the public reply, so the public text never promises something that failed.\n\nCredentials: Postgres (Supabase); OpenAI (both model nodes); Header Auth \"Meta page token\" (Authorization: Bearer + Page access token); X OAuth2 for X reply; Telegram.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_MODEL, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_GET_PRICE_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_DELIVERY_ZONE_WORKFLOW_ID (from Boss 4), YOUR_SAVE_LEAD_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_HANDOVER_WORKFLOW_ID.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "3c4d4ae6-8a58-44e4-9f51-e55b7d6b0692",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        -560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Supabase tables\n-- Run once in Supabase (SQL editor)\ncreate table inbox (\n  id bigserial primary key, platform text, kind text,\n  item_id text unique, thread_id text, author_handle text,\n  text text, source_link text, received_at timestamptz,\n  last_customer_msg_at timestamptz, status text default 'new',\n  intent text, urgent boolean, private_sent boolean default false,\n  answered_at timestamptz, alarm_sent boolean default false,\n  handover_reason text);\ncreate table leads (\n  id bigserial primary key, created_at timestamptz default now(),\n  platform text, handle_or_thread_id text, source_link text,\n  wants text, size_estimate text,\n  consent_followup boolean default false,\n  status text default 'new', owner text default 'Tolu');\ncreate table api_budget (\n  id bigserial primary key, api text, units int,\n  at timestamptz default now());\n\nSupabase is Postgres: create a Postgres credential with your Supabase database connection details (Project settings -> Database) so the nodes can run exact SQL.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "0b745797-644f-4299-b098-51ba119faa2b",
      "name": "Tables",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "6d565853-4255-4d8f-a0b8-d84cd93280b5",
      "name": "When called by a door",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "insert into inbox (platform, kind, item_id, thread_id, author_handle, text, source_link, received_at, last_customer_msg_at)\nvalues ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5, $6, $7, $8, $9)\non conflict (item_id) do nothing\nreturning *;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.platform, $json.kind, $json.item_id, $json.thread_id, $json.author_handle, $json.text, $json.source_link, $json.received_at, $json.last_customer_msg_at ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "4c55e688-68f0-423e-af98-8c071bb0ec02",
      "name": "Save to inbox (skip duplicates)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"sentiment\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"positive\",\n        \"neutral\",\n        \"negative\",\n        \"mixed\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"topic\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"quality\",\n        \"late delivery\",\n        \"price\",\n        \"refund\",\n        \"food safety\",\n        \"hours\",\n        \"other\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"urgent\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"description\": \"needs a person today\"\n    },\n    \"intent\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"praise\",\n        \"complaint\",\n        \"question\",\n        \"lead\",\n        \"spam\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"confidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 1\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"sentiment\",\n    \"topic\",\n    \"urgent\",\n    \"intent\",\n    \"confidence\"\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You label customer comments about Harvest Lane, a fresh-produce delivery business in Ibadan. Comments may be in Nigerian English, Pidgin, Yoruba, slang or emoji. Return sentiment, topic, urgent (needs a person today), intent and confidence (0 to 1, your honest estimate).\n\nExamples:\n1. \"Una tomatoes fresh well well, I go order again\" -> positive, quality, praise, urgent false\n2. \"Price don cost o\" -> neutral, price, complaint, urgent false (about price, not anger)\n3. \"This bread is sick 🔥\" -> positive, quality, praise, urgent false (sick = amazing)\n4. \"deadly jollof, we go come back\" -> positive, quality, praise, urgent false (deadly = excellent)\n5. \"Great, another 'fresh' delivery of soft tomatoes 🙄\" -> negative, quality, complaint, urgent false (sarcasm)\n6. \"Half the onions were rotten and nobody is picking my calls\" -> negative, quality, complaint, urgent true\n7. \"My son was sick after eating your ugu\" -> negative, food safety, complaint, urgent true\n8. \"What time do you open on Sundays?\" -> neutral, hours, question, urgent false\n9. \"Do you supply restaurants weekly? We need about 20 crates\" -> positive, other, lead, urgent false\n10. \"Delivery late again. Third time this month.\" -> negative, late delivery, complaint, urgent false\n11. \"Veggies dey fresh but the rider was rude\" -> mixed, other, complaint, urgent false\n12. \"I paid since Monday, nothing came. I want my money back\" -> negative, refund, complaint, urgent true\n13. \"Earn N50k daily!!! Click the link in my bio\" -> neutral, other, spam, urgent false"
        }
      },
      "id": "2e4ad824-b697-488c-b357-0848f0e5c31d",
      "name": "Label (5.3 labeller)",
